    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Providing children with a healthy, stimulating environment in their earliest years pays lifelong dividends. To help ensure policy and practice reflect this fact, the AKU Institute for Human Development is collaborating with other agencies of the Aga Khan Development Network to introduce professionals from government and NGOs to the science of early child development (ECD).",
